   "text": "Site owner pastes the snippet from the dashboard\n(Settings > Install):\n<script src=CDN/t/<version>/tracker.<hash>.js\nintegrity=sha384-... crossorigin> then init({\nsiteKey, endpoint }).\nPinned, hashed URL = existing installs never run\nchanged code.",
