   "type": "text",
   "id": "t10",
   "x": 52,
   "y": 344.5,
   "width": 392.00000000000006,
   "height": 367.5,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Built with tsup into one small bundle; version\ninjected at build time.\nsession.ts: session id + visitor pseudonym (no raw\nPII); referrer/UTM captured once per visit\nspa.ts: History API hook = SPA pageviews\nvitals.ts: LCP / CLS / INP / TTFB\nengagement.ts: active-time clock\nautocapture.ts: outbound links, downloads, scroll\ndepth\nconsent + DNT gate (grantConsent())\nidentify(userId, traits) / track(name, props)\nlimits.ts: clamps sizes of props and strings\ntransport.ts: batches <=50 events and <=30 KB per\nrequest, JSON POST with keepalive; sendBeacon on\npage hide; X-GI-Signature HMAC if signingSecret is\nset.\nRetry queue in localStorage (100 events, 5\nattempts, 5s to 5min backoff with jitter, events\nolder than 23h dropped).\nStatus handling: 2xx sent; 408/429/5xx retry;\n400/401/402/403 drop.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Built with tsup into one small bundle; version\ninjected at build time.\nsession.ts: session id + visitor pseudonym (no raw\nPII); referrer/UTM captured once per visit\nspa.ts: History API hook = SPA pageviews\nvitals.ts: LCP / CLS / INP / TTFB\nengagement.ts: active-time clock\nautocapture.ts: outbound links, downloads, scroll\ndepth\nconsent + DNT gate (grantConsent())\nidentify(userId, traits) / track(name, props)\nlimits.ts: clamps sizes of props and strings\ntransport.ts: batches <=50 events and <=30 KB per\nrequest, JSON POST with keepalive; sendBeacon on\npage hide; X-GI-Signature HMAC if signingSecret is\nset.\nRetry queue in localStorage (100 events, 5\nattempts, 5s to 5min backoff with jitter, events\nolder than 23h dropped).\nStatus handling: 2xx sent; 408/429/5xx retry;\n400/401/402/403 drop.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
