   "type": "text",
   "id": "t18",
   "x": 532,
   "y": 432,
   "width": 368.48,
   "height": 175,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "services/ingest-proxy (Go) or the nginx example\nin infra/examples.\nBrowser posts to analytics.customer.com/collect\n(same origin = fewer ad-blocker drops).\nProxy injects the HMAC signing secret\nserver-side (never in public HTML), enforces\nthe ALLOWED_ORIGINS CORS allow-list, forwards\nthe real client IP via X-Forwarded-For, 10 s\nupstream timeout, own /metrics.\nUsed when the site has signingRequired = true.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "services/ingest-proxy (Go) or the nginx example\nin infra/examples.\nBrowser posts to analytics.customer.com/collect\n(same origin = fewer ad-blocker drops).\nProxy injects the HMAC signing secret\nserver-side (never in public HTML), enforces\nthe ALLOWED_ORIGINS CORS allow-list, forwards\nthe real client IP via X-Forwarded-For, 10 s\nupstream timeout, own /metrics.\nUsed when the site has signingRequired = true.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
