   "type": "text",
   "id": "t39",
   "x": 992,
   "y": 791,
   "width": 603.6800000000001,
   "height": 122.5,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Default: ONE fused Lua script (EDGE_GATE_SCRIPT) = per-IP limit + per-site\nlimit + monthly workspace quota + event-id dedupe claims in a single round\ntrip. 429 if limited, quota-exceeded reply when plan is used up, 503 if Redis\nis down and ADMISSION_FAIL_CLOSED.\n[EDGE_LEASES] Doorman-style leases: local token bucket per site refreshed\nevery tick, local sliding-window IP counter, local dedupe fingerprints, quota\nwithdrawn in shrinking chunks = Redis off the per-request path.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Default: ONE fused Lua script (EDGE_GATE_SCRIPT) = per-IP limit + per-site\nlimit + monthly workspace quota + event-id dedupe claims in a single round\ntrip. 429 if limited, quota-exceeded reply when plan is used up, 503 if Redis\nis down and ADMISSION_FAIL_CLOSED.\n[EDGE_LEASES] Doorman-style leases: local token bucket per site refreshed\nevery tick, local sliding-window IP counter, local dedupe fingerprints, quota\nwithdrawn in shrinking chunks = Redis off the per-request path.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
