   "id": "t69",
   "x": 2082,
   "y": 110,
   "width": 272.16,
   "height": 22.5,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Event Worker - role: writer",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Event Worker - role: writer",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 554330,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7331030,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t70",
   "x": 2082,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 423.36,
   "height": 332.5,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "services/event-worker (Node + kafkajs), consumer group\nGROUP_ID.\n1 fetch big batches (minBytes / maxWait tuned for\nlarge inserts), zstd decode\n2 JSON.parse + zod contract check per event\n(contract.ts); invalid -> DLQ (dlq.ts)\n3 map to rows (toIngestRow): UTM, referrer, device,\ngeo, props JSON, web-vitals split out\n4 ClickHouse INSERT (writers/clickhouse.ts), mode\nWORKER_WRITE_V2 = off | shadow (legacy tables +\nevents_ingest) | only. Dedupe tokens from event ids so\na redelivered batch is not double counted\n5 commit Kafka offset only AFTER a successful insert\n(at-least-once)\n6 intent.ts records offset ranges so a crash replays\nthe identical block\nisolate.ts: one poisonous message cannot stall the\nwhole batch. Lag sampled via the admin API; Prometheus\nmetrics.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "services/event-worker (Node + kafkajs), consumer group\nGROUP_ID.\n1 fetch big batches (minBytes / maxWait tuned for\nlarge inserts), zstd decode\n2 JSON.parse + zod contract check per event\n(contract.ts); invalid -> DLQ (dlq.ts)\n3 map to rows (toIngestRow): UTM, referrer, device,\ngeo, props JSON, web-vitals split out\n4 ClickHouse INSERT (writers/clickhouse.ts), mode\nWORKER_WRITE_V2 = off | shadow (legacy tables +\nevents_ingest) | only. Dedupe tokens from event ids so\na redelivered batch is not double counted\n5 commit Kafka offset only AFTER a successful insert\n(at-least-once)\n6 intent.ts records offset ranges so a crash replays\nthe identical block\nisolate.ts: one poisonous message cannot stall the\nwhole batch. Lag sampled via the admin API; Prometheus\nmetrics.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
