   "originalText": "Event Worker - role: realtime",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 586006,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7749946,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t74",
   "x": 2082,
   "y": 584.5,
   "width": 423.36,
   "height": 140,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Separate consumer group <group>_realtime (minBytes=1,\n100 ms wait) so the live view stays fresh while the\nwriter uses big batches. state/redis-realtime.ts\npipelines per site: active sessions/visitors sets with\nTTL, top pages, recent events, then PUBLISH\nrt:notify:<siteId>. WORKER_ROLES=writer,realtime runs\nboth in one process, or split across deployments to\nscale each.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Separate consumer group <group>_realtime (minBytes=1,\n100 ms wait) so the live view stays fresh while the\nwriter uses big batches. state/redis-realtime.ts\npipelines per site: active sessions/visitors sets with\nTTL, top pages, recent events, then PUBLISH\nrt:notify:<siteId>. WORKER_ROLES=writer,realtime runs\nboth in one process, or split across deployments to\nscale each.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
