   "x": 2592,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 431.20000000000005,
   "height": 175,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Write path: events_ingest (Null engine) -> materialized\nviews -> events_v2 (MergeTree) + ~7 aggregate tables\n(daily site agg, dimension/filter daily, session-day,\nengagement, uniques via uniqCombined64, site_profiles).\nLegacy events_raw + web_vitals still written in shadow\nmode.\nRead path: dashboard queries use a read-only user;\nANALYTICS_READ = v1 | shadow | v2. Table TTL ceiling 60\nmonths; per-site retention enforced by the retention\njob. Migrations: infra/migrations/clickhouse/001..013.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Write path: events_ingest (Null engine) -> materialized\nviews -> events_v2 (MergeTree) + ~7 aggregate tables\n(daily site agg, dimension/filter daily, session-day,\nengagement, uniques via uniqCombined64, site_profiles).\nLegacy events_raw + web_vitals still written in shadow\nmode.\nRead path: dashboard queries use a read-only user;\nANALYTICS_READ = v1 | shadow | v2. Table TTL ceiling 60\nmonths; per-site retention enforced by the retention\njob. Migrations: infra/migrations/clickhouse/001..013.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
