   "id": "t113",
   "x": 52,
   "y": 1757,
   "width": 697.7600000000001,
   "height": 157.5,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "5 * * * * Hourly rollups: ClickHouse -> hourly aggregates for closed hours\n2,17,32,47 * * * * Daily rollups: resume where rollup tables end (repairs downtime, keeps\ntoday fresh)\n*/5 * * * * Quota reclaim: returns quota held by crashed edges\n*/15 * * * * Usage metering: ClickHouse truth -> Postgres usage_counters + Redis quota\n30 3 * * * Retention: delete data older than each site's retentionMonths\n20 4 * * * Reconciliation: edge-accepted vs stored rows, duplicate-rate + drift checks,\nraises alerts\nEach job is wrapped by instrumentJob() -> Prometheus metrics.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "5 * * * * Hourly rollups: ClickHouse -> hourly aggregates for closed hours\n2,17,32,47 * * * * Daily rollups: resume where rollup tables end (repairs downtime, keeps\ntoday fresh)\n*/5 * * * * Quota reclaim: returns quota held by crashed edges\n*/15 * * * * Usage metering: ClickHouse truth -> Postgres usage_counters + Redis quota\n30 3 * * * Retention: delete data older than each site's retentionMonths\n20 4 * * * Reconciliation: edge-accepted vs stored rows, duplicate-rate + drift checks,\nraises alerts\nEach job is wrapped by instrumentJob() -> Prometheus metrics.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
