   "height": 22.5,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Web app (apps/web, Next.js :3000) - dashboard + control-plane API",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Web app (apps/web, Next.js :3000) - dashboard + control-plane API",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 926523,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 12253293,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t117",
   "x": 852,
   "y": 1757,
   "width": 948.6400000000001,
   "height": 227.5,
   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "UI: marketing page, signup/login (password + email OTP), onboarding, invites, org settings, overview, realtime, pages,\nacquisition, geography, events, funnels, journeys, people, web vitals, public share links, legal pages.\nAuth: session cookie (SESSION_COOKIE_DOMAIN shared with docs), session store, CSP + security headers, rate-limited auth\nroutes, audit log.\nAuthZ (packages/authz): workspace membership + role permissions; scoped API keys; tenancy check on every site route.\nAPI /api/v1/*: workspaces, sites, settings, signing-secret rotation, goals, funnels (+insights), segments (+preview),\npeople, alert channels/rules/test, api-keys, members, invites, metrics overview/breakdown.\nRead path: packages/analytics -> ClickHouse (read-only user, result cache with single-flight + stale-while-revalidate,\ntenant gate).\nRealtime: /realtime/stream is SSE; one shared Redis subscriber (realtime-hub) fans rt:notify:<site> out to open browsers,\nwhich re-query.\nAlerts (lib/alerts.ts): rules in Postgres -> webhook / email channels through safe-fetch (SSRF guarded).\nSite-settings writes publish an invalidation to Redis so edges refresh within seconds.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "UI: marketing page, signup/login (password + email OTP), onboarding, invites, org settings, overview, realtime, pages,\nacquisition, geography, events, funnels, journeys, people, web vitals, public share links, legal pages.\nAuth: session cookie (SESSION_COOKIE_DOMAIN shared with docs), session store, CSP + security headers, rate-limited auth\nroutes, audit log.\nAuthZ (packages/authz): workspace membership + role permissions; scoped API keys; tenancy check on every site route.\nAPI /api/v1/*: workspaces, sites, settings, signing-secret rotation, goals, funnels (+insights), segments (+preview),\npeople, alert channels/rules/test, api-keys, members, invites, metrics overview/breakdown.\nRead path: packages/analytics -> ClickHouse (read-only user, result cache with single-flight + stale-while-revalidate,\ntenant gate).\nRealtime: /realtime/stream is SSE; one shared Redis subscriber (realtime-hub) fans rt:notify:<site> out to open browsers,\nwhich re-query.\nAlerts (lib/alerts.ts): rules in Postgres -> webhook / email channels through safe-fetch (SSRF guarded).\nSite-settings writes publish an invalidation to Redis so edges refresh within seconds.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
