   "strokeColor": "#333",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Local: infra/docker/docker-compose.yml (Postgres 16, ClickHouse 24, Redis 7,\nKafka 3.8; ports bound to 127.0.0.1). Managed: infra/aiven (Aiven Postgres /\nClickHouse / Kafka / Valkey + topic and migration scripts).\nPrometheus /metrics on edge, worker, scheduler, web, proxy;\ninfra/observability/alerts.yml + Grafana dashboard.\nCI (GitHub Actions): lint, typecheck, tests, build; Go vet/test +\ngovulncheck; security-guard script. Turborepo + pnpm monorepo.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Local: infra/docker/docker-compose.yml (Postgres 16, ClickHouse 24, Redis 7,\nKafka 3.8; ports bound to 127.0.0.1). Managed: infra/aiven (Aiven Postgres /\nClickHouse / Kafka / Valkey + topic and migration scripts).\nPrometheus /metrics on edge, worker, scheduler, web, proxy;\ninfra/observability/alerts.yml + Grafana dashboard.\nCI (GitHub Actions): lint, typecheck, tests, build; Go vet/test +\ngovulncheck; security-guard script. Turborepo + pnpm monorepo.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
